  "new_profile": {
    "name": "id-signed-record-cbor (design-stage; NOT implemented in production code)",
    "basis": "Settled V2 design, Cross-part identity profiles: canonical Body commits payload ID, length, domain and context; detached signature over domain-prefix + canonical Body; Body EXCLUDES signature and EnvelopeId; EnvelopeId hashes the complete canonical signed envelope INCLUDING signature and never includes itself in its preimage; deterministic CBOR encoding.",
    "instantiation_notes": "Worked example only, to make the design's invariants checkable: hash = SHA-256 where the design leaves the digest unnamed for PayloadId/EnvelopeId; domain prefix = utf8(domain) || 0x00. A follow-on implementation slice may adopt or amend these concrete choices; the invariants (exclusion from preimage, deterministic encoding) are the design's, not this file's.",
    "example": {
      "payload_utf8": "hello atlas",
      "payload_sha256_hex": "f9e10541696124d0875bebcaa1777f208d21ef3e4fbece2c0c85919d2054517d",
